Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Every lesson starts with a script.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,每节课都从一份脚本开始。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Write for the ear: one idea per sentence.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,为耳朵写作：一句一个意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.40,0:00:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,The voice is synthesized,\Nthen every word is aligned.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.40,0:00:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,先合成配音，再对齐每一个词。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.20,0:00:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Captions inherit those\Ntimestamps instead of guessing.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.20,0:00:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,字幕继承这些时间戳，而不是靠猜。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.60,0:00:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Two lines, one idea, inside the safe area.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.60,0:00:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,两行，一个意思，放在安全区内。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Then the cut: zooms,\Ncallouts, and an export.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后剪辑：缩放、批注，然后导出。
